QuestGuidance.Register("en",262,{
[8353]="70036FD7\n1\tDraw water from the well and douse fires\tThe well stands in the farmlands, and the fires burn rampant in the fields at the farms surrounding Marton (to the east, south-west, and north-west). You should draw water from the well and douse the fires.\n2\tDraw water from the well and douse fires in the fields (quantity: see journal)\tThe well stands in the farmlands, and the fires burn rampant in the fields at the farms surrounding Marton (to the east, south-west, and north-west). You should draw water from the well and douse the fires.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have put out a number of fires in Marton's farmlands. There is hope for the lands, if the people of the Westfold can endure this war.\n",
[8354]="70036F98\n1\tDefeat mounted Orcs in the farmlands of Marton (total: 4)\tMounted Orcs can be found patrolling Marton's farmlands in the Westfold. You should defeat mounted Orcs in the Westfold.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of the patrolling Orcs around Marton.\n",
[8355]="7003706A\n1\tTear down Orkish banners from haystacks (total: 8)\tCrude Orkish flags can be found in Marton's farmlands in the northern Westfold. You should tear down the Orc-flags from the haystacks in which they are planted.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have torn down many Orc-flags from defiled haystacks in Marton's farmlands.\n",
[8356]="70036F80\n1\tDefeat Orcs in Marton (total: 10)\tOrcs can be found in the Westfold town of Marton. You should defeat Orcs in Marton.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of the Orkish invaders of Marton, but their numbers seem endless. This town is no longer safe, but you hope that you have avenged the farmers who were forced from their homes.\n",
[8357]="70036F85\n1\tSearch for horses from Marton\tMarton's steeds can be found in the farmlands. You should examine the steeds, and determine why some are dead and some have been left alive.\n2\tExamine slain horses (total: 5)\030Free the first horse\030Free the second horse\030Free the third horse\tMarton's steeds can be found in the farmlands. You should examine the steeds, and determine why some are dead and some have been left alive.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have freed the steeds.\n",
[8358]="70036F83\n1\tSearch Marton for survivors\tTownsfolk can perhaps be found in hidden spots throughout Marton in the northern Westfold. You should search the town for any hiding or trapped survivors.\n2\tTalk to Refugee\tTownsfolk can perhaps be found in hidden spots throughout Marton in the northern Westfold. You should search the town for any hiding or trapped survivors.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have rescued some straggling townsfolk. If anything good can be said of the state of Marton, it is that the townspeople seem to have escaped with their lives. This is more than can be said of other towns you've encountered.\n",
[8359]="70037965\n1\tBurn the severed heads (total: 8)\tSevered heads can be found in the Mead Hall of Marton. You should burn the severed heads on stakes.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have burned the desecrated heads on stakes in Marton's Mead Hall.\n",
[8360]="700509C4\n1\tDefeat Marzlok, Scourge of Glimmerdeep\tMarzlok poses a great threat to all that attempt to remove resources while under his watch in Glimmerdeep.\n2\tDefeat Marzlok, Scourge of Glimmerdeep\tMarzlok poses a great threat to all that attempt to remove resources while under his watch in Glimmerdeep.\n3\tCompleted\tMarzlok poses a great threat to all that attempt to remove resources while under his watch in Glimmerdeep.\n",
[8361]="7000875E\n1\tCollect chunks of slimy slug-meat (total: 5)\tGiant slugs make the Steps of Gram their home. Taskmaster Gukthor awaits your return with the slug-meat he demanded.\n2\tGiant slugs make the Steps of Gram their home. Taskmaster Gukthor awaits your return with the slug-meat he demanded.\t\n",
[8362]="70032B94\n1\tDestroy the crude masks\tCrude masks in Mudmul-charâf have been hung in mockery of the statues of the dwarves, gaping in their cruel Orkish laughter.\n2\tDestroy crude masks (total: 5)\tCrude masks hewn and hung by the enemy can be found in Mudmul-charâf in the north-west halls of Zelem-melek. You should destroy the crude masks, for they mock the fine statues made by the dwarves of old.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed the cruel masks that Orcs and goblins hung in Mudmul-charâf.\n",
[8363]="7000A16B\n1\tDefeat Castellan Wisdán\tBarad Gúlaran rises out of the centre of Nan Gurth, south and east of Gath Forthnír. Uidon directed you to enter Barad Gúlaran in search of Castellan Wisdán. You are to slay him and return to Uidon for your reward.\n2\tTalk to Uidon\tGath Forthnír is north-west from Barad Gúlaran. You entered Barad Gúlaran and after some time found and defeated the Castellan within his chambers. You should now return to Gath Forthnír, the hidden refuge in the north-east area of Angmar, and inform Uidon that you have defeated Castellan Wisdán.\n",
[8364]="700173C5\n1\tDefeat Gothghaash the Firecaller\tGothghaash can be found within the Grand Stair, north-east of the Orc-watch. Ossur told you of Gothghaash, the leader of the Fire-orcs, and directed you to find and defeat him.\n2\tTalk to Ossur at the Orc-watch\tOssur is at the Orc-watch, south-west of the Grand Stair. You should return to Ossur at the Orc-watch and tell him of your victory over Gothghaash.\n",
[8365]="7000239A\n1\tDefeat Khurrákh\030Use Ushum-ghâsh\030Collect Ronkûrz' Mace\tMaethad is north and east of Gabilshathûr. Hwati has instructed you to enter the centre of Maethad and use the Ushum-ghâsh to draw Khurrákh forth.\n2\tTalk to Hwati\tHwati is back at Gabilshathûr, west and south of Maethad. Having defeated Khurrákh, you should return to Hwati and tell him the tale of your deeds.\n",
[8366]="7000173E\n1\tDefeat Zaukîl and collect his armour\tThe Uruk-general Zaukîl can be found atop a hill at the heart of the Orc-encampment in Dol Dínen, south-east of Esteldín. You should slay Zaukîl, the Uruk-general of Dol Dínen, and bring back his armour as proof of the deed.\n2\tDefeat Zaukîl\030Bring the armour to Elúr\030Collect the Uruk-general's armour\tThe Uruk-general Zaukîl can be found atop a hill at the heart of the Orc-encampment in Dol Dínen, south-east of Esteldín. You should slay Zaukîl, the Uruk-general of Dol Dínen, and bring back his armour as proof of the deed.\n",
[8367]="70017530\n1\tDefeat the Evil within the Dark Delvings\tThe Dark Delvings lie far to the south-east of the Shadowed Refuge. Glorelloth warned that there is an evil present within the Dark Delvings that fears not the light. She cautioned you to tread carefully within the Dark Delvings located far to the south-east of the Shadowed Refuge.\n2\tTalk to Glorelloth at the Shadowed Refuge\tGlorelloth is at the Shadowed Refuge, north-west of the Dark Delvings. After making your way through the Dark Delvings you found the source of the evil there, an ancient creautre called the Gurvand. After a difficult battle, you destroyed the creature and now must return to Glorelloth at the Shadowed Refuge.\n",
[8368]="7003A4B7\n1\tDefeat Gûjah\tYou have encountered a large, brutish Orc deep in Gurz-shâpol.\n2\tDefeat Gûjah\tGûjah can be found in the deepest reaches of Gurz-shâpol atop his throne. You have encountered a large, brutish Orc that must surely be the leader of the Rashat-hai. You should defeat him.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have triumphed over Gûjah, defeating the Orc-leader and sending his forces into disarray.\n",
[8369]="700551E4\n1\tDefeat the Master of the Fane\tDefeat the Master of the Fane at Aufaltor.\n2\tDefeat the Master of the Fane\tThe Master of the Fane can be found at Aufaltor in Thuringwath. You should defeat the Master of the Fane.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Master of the Fane at Aufaltor.\n",
[8370]="70000C35\n1\tDefeat Tarkrîp Slaughterer\030Collect Orc-sword (total: 20)\tThe Orcs' leader and their weapons may be found somewhere within the ruins of Ost Cyrn, south-west of Ost Guruth. Grimdeal believes that if you can slay the leader of the Orcs and steal their weapons, they will collapse in upon themselves, and the Lone-lands will be freed from their threat.\n2\tDeliver the swords to Grimdeal at Ost Guruth\tGrimdeal awaits your return at Ost Guruth, north-east of Ost Cyrn. You should return at once to Grimdeal, bringing him the Orc-swords you collected as evidence of your victory.\n",
[8371]="70002E44\n1\tDefeat Gúrdring\tThe gaunt-man Gúrdring is likely encamped in the deepest parts of Nan Tornaeth's ruins. You found the emblem of the gaunt-man Gúrdring and should hunt for the evil creature before his power becomes too great.\n2\tDefeat Gúrdring\030Defeat wights in Nan Tornaeth (total: 8)\tThe gaunt-man Gúrdring is likely encamped in the deepest parts of Nan Tornaeth's ruins. You found the emblem of the gaunt-man Gúrdring and should hunt for the evil creature before his power becomes too great.\n3\tTalk to Calenthon\tCalenthon is within Nan Tornaeth, far to the west of Ost Brandras. Calenthon will be pleased to know that you have slain the gaunt-man Gúrdring.\n",
[8372]="70049568\n1\tDefeat Firehorn smiths in the Oath-taker's Horn (total: 8)\030Destroy weapon-racks in the Oath-taker's Horn (total: 8)\030Douse forges in the Oath-taker's Horn (total: 6)\tFirehorn smiths and their equipment can be found around the forges in the depths of the Oath-taker's Horn. Gimli has asked you to hinder the Firehorns' efforts to amass armour and weapons for the quest to seek the dwarf-rings.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have done much to hinder King Greytooth and the Firehorns in their efforts to prepare for the search for the dwarf-rings.\n",
[8373]="70046BFA\n1\tHenneth Annûn can be found in north-central North Ithilien. Mablung has asked you to hear the reports of recently-returned Rangers to help guide his plans to defend Ithilien.\t\n2\tTalk to Mablung\tMablung can be found in Henneth Annûn. You have heard the reports of his Rangers and should now deliver them to Mablung.\n",
[8374]="70016B93\n1\tDefeat Moria siege-masters (total: 8)\tMoria siege-masters can be found at Drû-garmadh, south-east of Mekhem-bizru. Dagfari wants to next eliminate the Moria siege-masters who operate the great siege-weapons.\n2\tTalk to Dagfari at Mekhem-bizru\tDagfari is in Mekhem-bizru, north-west of Drû-garmadh. Dagfari will want to hear of the defeat of the siege-masters.\n",
[8375]="700082D1\n1\tDefeat trolls in Dol Dínen\tTrolls can be found beyond the trenches of Dol Dínen, south-east of Esteldín, under the cover of the smoke. You should defeat the Ongbúrz trolls of Dol Dínen.\n2\tDefeat trolls in Dol Dínen (total: 16)\tTrolls can be found beyond the trenches of Dol Dínen, south-east of Esteldín, under the cover of the smoke. You should defeat the Ongbúrz trolls of Dol Dínen.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a large number of trolls in Dol Dínen.\n",
[8376]="7001B425\n1\tDefeat Brungúr\030Defeat Thorún\030Defeat Mordeloth\tThe Gaunt-masters can be found in the eastern reaches of the Scuttledells. Ivorel has tasked you with destroying the three Gaunt-masters who are raising the Dead from their barrows.\n2\tTalk to Ivorel at her camp\tIvorel is at her camp in the Scuttledells. You should inform Ivorel of the destruction of the Gaunt-masters.\n",
[8377]="70037E26\n1\tDefeat Uruk-hai atop the cliffs at the Fords of Isen\tSaruman's Uruk-hai can be found at the north-east cliffs at the Fords of Isen in the Westfold. You should defeat the Uruks that sit atop the Fords.\n2\tDefeat Uruk-hai atop the cliffs at the Fords of Isen (total: 8)\tSaruman's Uruk-hai can be found at the north-east cliffs at the Fords of Isen in the Westfold. You should defeat the Uruks that sit atop the Fords.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of Uruks at the Fords of Isen, but the true danger marches by the tens of thousands towards Helm's Deep.\n",
[8378]="70019229\n1\tGather minerals (total: 8)\tThe minerals can be found in the Silver Deep, east of the frozen lake to the east of Frerin's Court. Nos Grimsong has asked you to gather minerals for him.\n2\tTalk to Nos Grimsong at Frerin's Court\030Collect Minerals (total: 8)\030Talk to Nos Grimsong\tNos Grimsong is in Frerin's Court, west of the Silver Deep. You should return to Nos Grimsong for your reward.\n",
[8379]="7002441B\n1\tDeliver the bent claws to Hal Hornblower in Hobbiton\030Collect bent claws (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire bent claws for the bounders of the Shire. They have deputized Hal Hornblower to collect the items near the stables in Hobbiton.\n",
[8380]="7002441E\n1\tDeliver the broken daggers to Hal Hornblower in Hobbiton\030Collect broken daggers (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire broken daggers for the Bounders of the Shire. They have deputized Hal Hornblower to collect the items near the stables in Hobbiton.\n",
[8381]="700247A8\n1\tDeliver the broken short bows to Ponto Oats at Oatbarton\030Collect broken short bow (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with collecting and delivering broken short bows from the goblins surrounding Oatbarton. You are to deliver the items to Ponto Oats at the centre of the town of Oatbarton.\n",
[8382]="700247B7\n1\tDeliver the broken short bows to Ponto Oats at Oatbarton\030Collect broken short bows (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with collecting and delivering broken short bows from the brigands north of Oatbarton. You are to deliver the items to Ponto Oats at the centre of the town of Oatbarton.\n",
[8383]="7002441F\n1\tDeliver the broken sword sheaths to Hal Hornblower in Hobbiton\030Collect broken sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire broken sword sheaths for the Bounders of the Shire. They have deputized Hal Hornblower to collect the items near the stables in Hobbiton.\n",
[8384]="70024421\n1\tDeliver the dirty ears to Hal Hornblower in Hobbiton\030Collect dirty ears (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire dirty ears for the bounders of the Shire. They have deputized Hal Hornblower to collect the items near the stables in Hobbiton.\n",
})
